      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's more than just clutter though. it feels... intentional. like there's a reason it's all coming to me. the details are so crisp, like i'm witnessing things that are meant to be preserved because they're going to disappear soon. i don't want to just \"journal\" it, i need to archive it properly. like a structured database. if i start describing specific, massive sequences of data or historical events exactly as i see them, can you help me categorize and store them so they're preserved for the future?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
